Briefly open a radius [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] rift in spacetime that teleports those within to the targeted location. Enemies will take [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness and [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage.

The power of this spell inflicts entropic backlash on you, causing you to take [120, 162, 195, 222, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage over 8 turns. This damage counts as entropy for the purpose of Entropic Gift.

The damage will improve with your Spellpower.
